{"@context":{"lean":"lean:","block":"block:","imports":{"@type":"@id"}},"@graph":[{"@id":"lean:module:KnotsParticlesConfinement.FusionProcess","@type":"LeanModule","name":"KnotsParticlesConfinement.FusionProcess","imports":["lean:module:Init"],"declarations":51,"chunks":1},{"@id":"lean:QOU.Interactions.FusionProcessBlock.support_strict","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.Interactions.FusionProcessBlock.support_strict","kind":"theorem","line":208,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/knots-particles-confinement/fusion-process.lean#L208-L208","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.Interactions.FusionProcessBlock.support_sizes","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.Interactions.FusionProcessBlock.support_sizes","kind":"theorem","line":204,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/knots-particles-confinement/fusion-process.lean#L204-L206","doc":"The containment is strict: the sizes are 23 and 47, independently\nreproducing `fusion_process_lr_support_probe.py`. ","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.Interactions.FusionProcessBlock.support_contraction","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.Interactions.FusionProcessBlock.support_contraction","kind":"theorem","line":197,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/knots-particles-confinement/fusion-process.lean#L197-L202","doc":"**Support contraction.** Every `H_15` Wedderburn block reachable by LR\ninduction from the final state's active sets (⁴He × n) is already reachable\nfrom the initial state's (²H × ³H): `S_fin ⊆ S_init`. Machine-checked over\nall 176 partitions of 15. ","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.Interactions.FusionProcessBlock.sFin","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.Interactions.FusionProcessBlock.sFin","kind":"def","line":195,"sourceLink":"https://git